        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A CAFFEINE EMPIRE IN SPACE</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the manager of a remote coffee outpost on the edge of known space. One machine. Zero workers. Your job: turn this into a galaxy-supplying operation.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit <strong>33 unique alien workers</strong>—baristas, technicians, traders, support units, and fighters—and watch them automate every step of production. Expand across <strong>6 themed decks</strong>, from the industrial Engineering bay to the VIP lounge. Each deck multiplies your entire station's output.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089330/extras/20757da50295e7ab5487932efd6f7fa0.avif?t=1786472345\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RIDE THE RUSH</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 8 minutes, <strong>Rush Hour</strong> hits. For 45 seconds, machines run at infinite capacity and earnings double. Ships streak past your station as you capitalize on the surge.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're ready, face one of <strong>8 Galactic Inspector variants</strong> in a boss fight to earn your prestige reset.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089330/extras/76523ac68a43d5164cc07185ab6997b9.avif?t=1786472345\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESTIGE THAT MATTERS</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the Inspector, reset, and earn <strong>Prestige Tokens</strong>. But this isn't &quot;buy upgrades in order.&quot; You choose your path:</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Automation Mastery</strong> – Boost trader income and offline production<br></li><li><strong>Active Mastery</strong> – Enhance Rush Hour rewards and morale bonuses<br></li><li><strong>Combat Mastery</strong> – Increase fighter damage and boss click power</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond prestige tokens: R&amp;D research, unit specialization trees, deck synergies, shrines, achievement buffs, and daily streaks. Multiple systems working together = weeks of meaningful progression. Random run modifiers keep each prestige fresh.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089330/extras/f703d3db4944af9d91e9b2b10ce283fe.avif?t=1786472345\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DETAILS</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free and complete.</strong> No paywalls. Designed to finish without spending a cent. Optional cosmetic DLC for supporters.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible.</strong> 28 languages, colorblind modes, controller support, camera shake toggle.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamer-friendly.</strong> Twitch integration shows viewer names on units.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guided by ARIA.</strong> Your station AI walks you through every system with dark humor and dynamic expressions.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089330/extras/c00b5aaaff7d7e97f30e3bfef6a97c21.avif?t=1786472345\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A CAFFEINE EMPIRE IN SPACE</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the manager of a remote coffee outpost on the edge of known space. One machine. Zero workers. Your job: turn this into a galaxy-supplying operation.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit <strong>33 unique alien workers</strong>—baristas, technicians, traders, support units, and fighters—and watch them automate every step of production. Expand across <strong>6 themed decks</strong>, from the industrial Engineering bay to the VIP lounge. Each deck multiplies your entire station's output.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089330/extras/20757da50295e7ab5487932efd6f7fa0.avif?t=1786472345\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RIDE THE RUSH</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 8 minutes, <strong>Rush Hour</strong> hits. For 45 seconds, machines run at infinite capacity and earnings double. Ships streak past your station as you capitalize on the surge.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're ready, face one of <strong>8 Galactic Inspector variants</strong> in a boss fight to earn your prestige reset.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089330/extras/76523ac68a43d5164cc07185ab6997b9.avif?t=1786472345\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESTIGE THAT MATTERS</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the Inspector, reset, and earn <strong>Prestige Tokens</strong>. But this isn't &quot;buy upgrades in order.&quot; You choose your path:</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Automation Mastery</strong> – Boost trader income and offline production<br></li><li><strong>Active Mastery</strong> – Enhance Rush Hour rewards and morale bonuses<br></li><li><strong>Combat Mastery</strong> – Increase fighter damage and boss click power</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond prestige tokens: R&amp;D research, unit specialization trees, deck synergies, shrines, achievement buffs, and daily streaks. Multiple systems working together = weeks of meaningful progression. Random run modifiers keep each prestige fresh.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089330/extras/f703d3db4944af9d91e9b2b10ce283fe.avif?t=1786472345\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DETAILS</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free and complete.</strong> No paywalls. Designed to finish without spending a cent. Optional cosmetic DLC for supporters.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible.</strong> 28 languages, colorblind modes, controller support, camera shake toggle.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamer-friendly.</strong> Twitch integration shows viewer names on units.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guided by ARIA.</strong> Your station AI walks you through every system with dark humor and dynamic expressions.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089330/extras/c00b5aaaff7d7e97f30e3bfef6a97c21.avif?t=1786472345\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Run a coffee empire in space. Hire 33 alien workers, automate brewing across 6 decks, and ride the chaos of Rush Hour surges. Prestige resets unlock layered progression systems that'll keep you optimizing for weeks. Free to play, no paywalls.",
